		],
		"en": [
			"Maxion's army rolls out the latest, powerful aircraft specializing in close combat, \"Levinix\"! !",
			"• Comes with unique weapons specialized for close combat.",
			"• Armed with a chakram dagger, large sword, and revolver.",
			"• Chakram dagger can be rearranged into 3-blade and 1-blade.",
			"• The small armor can be attached to any location using a 3mm joint."
